{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21807","headline":"有酒十章 一 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒鸡初鸣，夜长睡足神虑清。\n悄然危坐心不平，浩思一气初彭亨。\n澒洞浩汗真无名，胡不终浑成。\n胡爲沈浊以升清，矗然分画高下程。\n天蒸地郁羣动萌，毛鳞裸介如鬇鬡。\n呜呼万物纷已生，我可奈何兮杯一倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}